{"id": "36954", "title": "绝情刀", "author": "秋梦痕", "category": "武侠修真", "count": 32, "available": 12, "cover": "files/article/image/36/36954/36954s.jpg", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/36/36954.htm", "intro": "黄昏时分，有一个人在残阳夕照下唱着流浪之歌：\r\n\r\n　　秋风起，秋草黄。\r\n\r\n　　残阳埋进沙岗。\r\n\r\n　　暮鸦归，雁南飞。\r\n\r\n　　牧人回望；\r\n\r\n　　天涯苍茫。\r\n\r\n　　流浪人啊！\r\n\r\n　　我要回故乡——\r\n\r\n　　故乡是营飞草长的地方。\r\n\r\n　　那里，山碧水又长……", "base": "files/article/html/36/36954", "chapters": [{"title": "正文", "volume": true}, {"title": "第一章　驼影怪剑", "file": "2877840.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二章 血染荒山", "file": "6815152.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第三章 显刀献艺", "file": "6815153.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第四章 华山双宿", "file": "6815154.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第五章　阴魄玄功", "file": "2877841.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第六章 金蝉脱壳", "file": "6815155.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第七章 恨楼血亭", "file": "6815156.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第八章 秘谷幽兰", "file": "6815157.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第九章 冥君丧命", "file": "6815158.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十章 五湖醉客", "file": "6815159.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十一章 大漠巡使", "file": "6815160.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十二章 怒刀仙翁", "file": "6815161.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十三章 龙虎双丐", "file": "6815162.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十四章 阴山书生", "file": "6815163.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十五章 金牛现身", "file": "6815164.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十六章 怀刀受命", "file": "6815165.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十七章 水牢救母", "file": "6815166.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二章　血染荒山", "file": "2877842.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第六章　金蝉脱壳", "file": "2877843.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第三章　显刀献艺", "file": "2877844.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第七章　恨楼血亭", "file": "2877845.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第四章　华山双宿", "file": "2877846.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第八章　秘谷幽兰", "file": "2